_:n4a6f12b1c05e4930b61c0d6900a4ff1bb9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n4a6f12b1c05e4930b61c0d6900a4ff1bb10 .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\nAn expression work/expression having another one as supplement.\n        "@en .
<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#supplement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:n4a6f12b1c05e4930b61c0d6900a4ff1bb8 .
